---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
import AmazonButton from '../../components/AmazonButton.astro';
import PlannerCTA from '../../components/PlannerCTA.astro';
import SelectSaunasButton from '../../components/SelectSaunasButton.astro';

const kenovaUrl = "https://selectsaunas.com/products/almost-heaven-kenova-4-6-person-barrel-sauna-6x7-ft";

const faqSchema = {
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "FAQPage",
  "mainEntity": [
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "Which Almost Heaven barrel sauna should I compare first?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "Start with the exact bench length, exterior dimensions, intended users, heater package, electrical service, delivery method, and foundation. The Pinnacle is a current 6-foot class path, while the Princeton and Kenova provide longer interiors for buyers who need more bench room."
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "Do current Almost Heaven barrel saunas include a heater?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "Current product pages show selectable heater configurations, and the included package depends on the exact model and option chosen. Confirm the checkout configuration, controls, stones, electrical requirements, and warranty rather than assuming the room and heater are sold separately."
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "How many adults fit in an Almost Heaven barrel sauna?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "Capacity labels are maximums, not comfort measurements. Compare the published interior and bench dimensions with the actual users, desired posture, door and heater layout, and whether anyone wants to recline."
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "How long does an Almost Heaven barrel sauna take to assemble?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "Assembly time varies by model, configuration, site preparation, crew, tools, weather, and experience. Review the current manual and delivery scope before scheduling labor; do not rely on a universal one-day estimate."
      }
    }
  ]
};
---
<Base
  title="Almost Heaven Barrel Sauna Review (2026): Compare Current Models"
  description="Compare current Almost Heaven barrel sauna paths by exact dimensions, bench room, heater configuration, electrical service, delivery, foundation, and buyer fit."
  canonical="/guides/almost-heaven-barrel-sauna"
>
  <script type="application/ld+json" set:html={JSON.stringify(faqSchema)} />

  <article class="max-w-3xl mx-auto">
    <p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-amber-700 mb-3">Model comparison</p>
    <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold text-stone-900 mb-3">Almost Heaven barrel saunas: choose by dimensions, not capacity</h1>
    <p class="text-stone-500 mb-8">Reviewed August 15, 2026 &mdash; Backyard Sauna Pro</p>

    <div class="rounded-xl overflow-hidden mb-3">
      <img src="/images/lifestyle/barrel-sauna-field.jpg" alt="Representative outdoor barrel sauna in a grassy setting" class="w-full object-cover max-h-80" loading="lazy" width="1200" height="800" />
    </div>
    <p class="text-xs text-stone-500 mb-8">Representative barrel sauna; model details must come from the current product page and manual.</p>

    <div class="bg-amber-50 border border-amber-200 rounded-xl p-5 mb-8 text-sm text-stone-700">
      <strong>Affiliate disclosure:</strong> As an Amazon Associate I earn from qualifying purchases. This page also contains affiliate links to Select Saunas.
    </div>

    <div class="bg-stone-100 border border-stone-200 rounded-xl p-5 mb-8 text-sm text-stone-700">
      <strong>Research scope:</strong> This is a desk-researched buying guide, not a hands-on test. We reviewed current manufacturer and authorized-dealer product pages. We have not assembled, heated, measured, or inspected these saunas.
    </div>

    <p class="text-lg text-stone-700 mb-4">Almost Heaven now sells many configurable barrel models. The old shortcut of calling one model the universal "best buy" misses the expensive parts of the decision: usable bench length, heater and controls, circuit, foundation, freight, offload, weather package, and the exact door and window configuration.</p>
    <p class="text-stone-700 mb-8">Pick a size class first. Then compare the actual configuration that will arrive.</p>

    <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-stone-900 mt-10 mb-4">Three current paths</h2>
    <div class="overflow-x-auto border border-stone-200 rounded-lg mb-8">
      <table class="w-full min-w-[760px] text-sm text-left">
        <thead class="bg-stone-100 text-stone-900">
          <tr>
            <th scope="col" class="px-4 py-3 font-bold">Model path</th>
            <th scope="col" class="px-4 py-3 font-bold">Published exterior</th>
            <th scope="col" class="px-4 py-3 font-bold">Published bench</th>
            <th scope="col" class="px-4 py-3 font-bold">Current heater path</th>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody class="divide-y divide-stone-200 text-stone-700">
          <tr class="align-top">
            <th scope="row" class="px-4 py-3 font-semibold text-stone-900">Pinnacle 4-Person</th>
            <td class="px-4 py-3">78 W x 71 D x 81 1/2 H inches on the configuration checked</td>
            <td class="px-4 py-3">Two 16 W x 63 1/4 L inch benches</td>
            <td class="px-4 py-3">6kW, 240V / 30A hardwired options shown</td>
          </tr>
          <tr class="align-top">
            <th scope="row" class="px-4 py-3 font-semibold text-stone-900">Princeton 6-Person</th>
            <td class="px-4 py-3">78 W x 94 D x 75 3/8 H inches</td>
            <td class="px-4 py-3">Two 16 W x 86 3/8 L inch benches</td>
            <td class="px-4 py-3">8kW, 240V / 40A hardwired options shown</td>
          </tr>
          <tr class="align-top">
            <th scope="row" class="px-4 py-3 font-semibold text-stone-900">Kenova 4-6 Person</th>
            <td class="px-4 py-3">6-by-7-foot class dealer listing</td>
            <td class="px-4 py-3">Compare dealer drawing and selected interior</td>
            <td class="px-4 py-3">Current dealer package lists an 8kW heater path</td>
          </tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>
    <p class="text-xs text-stone-500 mb-8">Specifications checked August 15, 2026. Recheck the selected configuration before purchase.</p>

    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-4 mb-10">
      <div class="border border-stone-200 rounded-xl p-5 bg-white">
        <p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-amber-700 mb-1">Current affiliate path</p>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-stone-900 mb-2">Pinnacle 4-Person</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-stone-700 mb-4">Use the current listing to confirm the configured lumber, door, window, heater, controls, stones, freight, lead time, and warranty. The displayed capacity does not establish four-adult comfort.</p>
        <AmazonButton asin="B017WJV8SO" variant="primary" ctaPosition="almost_heaven_pinnacle" />
      </div>
      <div class="border border-stone-200 rounded-xl p-5 bg-white">
        <p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-amber-700 mb-1">Longer barrel path</p>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-stone-900 mb-2">Kenova 4-6 Person</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-stone-700 mb-4">The dealer listing expands the room and heater package. Verify bench dimensions, configured load, electrical service, foundation, weather protection, and offload before treating it as the better group option.</p>
        <SelectSaunasButton href={kenovaUrl} label="Check the current Kenova listing" ctaPosition="almost_heaven_kenova" />
      </div>
    </div>

    <PlannerCTA
      source="almost_heaven_model_compare"
      heading="Compare the configured project, not just the barrel"
      description="Record the intended users, bench posture, site, foundation, circuit, delivery path, budget, ZIP code, and timeline before choosing a model."
    />

    <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-stone-900 mt-10 mb-4">What changed from older buying advice</h2>
    <div class="space-y-4 mb-10">
      <div class="border-l-4 border-amber-400 pl-4">
        <h3 class="font-bold text-stone-900 mb-1">The heater is configuration-specific</h3>
        <p class="text-stone-700">Current product pages show selectable heater packages. Do not budget from an old claim that every room kit excludes the heater. Confirm exactly what the selected checkout option includes.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="border-l-4 border-amber-400 pl-4">
        <h3 class="font-bold text-stone-900 mb-1">List prices are not durable comparison data</h3>
        <p class="text-stone-700">Prices, promotions, freight, controls, windows, lumber, and heater packages change. Compare the complete configured project on the same day rather than carrying a fixed 2025 price into the decision.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="border-l-4 border-amber-400 pl-4">
        <h3 class="font-bold text-stone-900 mb-1">Capacity is not comfort</h3>
        <p class="text-stone-700">Use bench length and width, the actual users, heater and door positions, and the desired seated or reclining posture. A maximum capacity label is not a promise of personal space.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="border-l-4 border-amber-400 pl-4">
        <h3 class="font-bold text-stone-900 mb-1">Assembly is a project variable</h3>
        <p class="text-stone-700">Manual scope, foundation readiness, crew, tools, weather, delivery, configuration, and experience all affect timing. Review the current manual before scheduling a one-day build.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-stone-900 mt-10 mb-4">Seven checks before checkout</h2>
    <ol class="list-decimal pl-5 space-y-4 text-stone-700 mb-10">
      <li><strong>Bench fit:</strong> compare published bench dimensions with the actual users and intended posture.</li>
      <li><strong>Selected package:</strong> capture the exact lumber, door, windows, heater, controls, stones, accessories, and model revision.</li>
      <li><strong>Site and foundation:</strong> follow the current manual and site-specific structural, drainage, frost, and anchoring requirements.</li>
      <li><strong>Electrical:</strong> have a qualified electrician confirm heater, controls, lighting, circuit, panel capacity, disconnects, and permit needs.</li>
      <li><strong>Freight and offload:</strong> verify crate or pallet details, curbside obligations, appointment, access, storage, damage inspection, and return process.</li>
      <li><strong>Weather exposure:</strong> identify the exterior treatment, roof or rain protection, drainage, snow and wind needs, and maintenance schedule for the selected model.</li>
      <li><strong>Warranty responsibility:</strong> confirm who supports the room, heater, controls, freight damage, missing parts, and replacement components.</li>
    </ol>

    <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-stone-900 mt-10 mb-4">Current KIP60B research path</h2>
    <p class="text-stone-700 mb-4">The Harvia KIP60B remains a current 6kW, 240VAC, single-phase heater with built-in controls. It is not automatically correct for every barrel or configuration. Use the selected room volume, glass and uninsulated surfaces, climate, current manual, controls, and electrical design.</p>
    <AmazonButton asin="B0B7TRM95Y" variant="outline" label="View the current KIP60B listing" ctaPosition="almost_heaven_kip" />

    <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-stone-900 mt-10 mb-4">Primary sources checked</h2>
    <ul class="space-y-3 text-sm text-stone-700 mb-10">
      <li><a href="https://almostheaven.com/products/pinnacle-4-person-barrel-sauna" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-amber-700 font-semibold hover:underline">Almost Heaven: current Pinnacle specifications and manual access</a></li>
      <li><a href="https://almostheaven.com/products/princeton-6-person-barrel-sauna" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-amber-700 font-semibold hover:underline">Almost Heaven: current Princeton specifications and manual access</a></li>
      <li><a href="https://selectsaunas.com/products/almost-heaven-kenova-4-6-person-barrel-sauna-6x7-ft?sca_ref=10752576.S2huPg7gFg" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener sponsored" class="text-amber-700 font-semibold hover:underline">Select Saunas: current Kenova package</a></li>
      <li><a href="https://www.harvia.com/en-US/products/JH60BU1UL/kip60b-6-kw-240vac-steel-ul" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-amber-700 font-semibold hover:underline">Harvia: KIP60B product data and manual access</a></li>
    </ul>

    <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-stone-900 mt-10 mb-4">FAQ</h2>
    <div class="space-y-5">
      <div><h3 class="font-bold text-stone-900 mb-1">Which model should I compare first?</h3><p class="text-stone-700">Start with the bench length, exterior dimensions, users, heater package, circuit, delivery, and foundation. The size class should follow those needs.</p></div>
      <div><h3 class="font-bold text-stone-900 mb-1">Does the sauna include a heater?</h3><p class="text-stone-700">Current pages show selectable heater configurations. Confirm the exact checkout package, controls, stones, electrical needs, and warranty.</p></div>
      <div><h3 class="font-bold text-stone-900 mb-1">How many adults fit?</h3><p class="text-stone-700">Measure comfort from the published benches and actual users. Treat the capacity label as a maximum, not a comfort rating.</p></div>
      <div><h3 class="font-bold text-stone-900 mb-1">How long does assembly take?</h3><p class="text-stone-700">It varies. Review the current manual and account for site preparation, configuration, crew, tools, weather, and delivery.</p></div>
    </div>

    <div class="bg-stone-50 border border-stone-200 rounded-xl p-6 mt-10">
      <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-stone-900 mb-2">Continue planning</h3>
      <ul class="space-y-2 text-sm">
        <li><a href="/brands/almost-heaven-sauna-review/" class="text-amber-700 hover:underline">Almost Heaven Brand Research</a></li>
        <li><a href="/guides/barrel-sauna-costco/" class="text-amber-700 hover:underline">Compare the current Costco barrel bundle</a></li>
        <li><a href="/guides/sauna-foundation-guide/" class="text-amber-700 hover:underline">Sauna Foundation Guide</a></li>
        <li><a href="/guides/sauna-electrical-requirements/" class="text-amber-700 hover:underline">Sauna Electrical Planning</a></li>
        <li><a href="/guides/outdoor-sauna-buying-checklist/" class="text-amber-700 hover:underline">Outdoor Sauna Buying Checklist</a></li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </article>
</Base>
